# Intent: The xiaozhi side of the hard mute (patch 106): while muted or in full quiet AudioService::ReadAudioData reads nothing, so nothing is fed to the wake word; EnableWakeWordDetection(true) and EnableVoiceProcessing(true) refuse; Application::SetListeningMode, the one way into listening (tap, wake word, host start, reconnect), refuses and puts the unit back to idle; a wake word that arrives after the mute is dropped. Unmuting needs nothing here: the audio task opens the microphone on its next read.
# Placement: unit (the audio path runs on the robot)
# Upstream: main/audio/audio_service.cc and main/application.cc of the xiaozhi-esp32 tree (MIT)
